<text:h text:outline-level="1">Chapter one</text:h>
<text:p>First paragraph with a caf&#233; and &#8220;quotes&#8221; &amp; an ampersand &lt;tag&gt;.</text:p>
<text:p>&#932;&#959; &#946;&#953;&#946;&#955;&#943;&#959; &#949;&#943;&#957;&#945;&#953; &#949;&#948;&#974;.</text:p>
<text:p>A link: <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="http://example.com/">link text</text:a> and after.</text:p>
<text:p>Page <text:page-number text:select-page="current">1</text:page-number> and a note<text:note text:id="ftn1" text:note-class="footnote"><text:note-citation>1</text:note-citation><text:note-body><text:p>The footnote text.</text:p></text:note-body></text:note> here.</text:p>
